{"seq":3,"slug":"defi-security","title":"DeFi 安全","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/defi-security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reentrancy-and-flash-loans","title":"重入攻击与闪电贷","url":"/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/defi-security/reentrancy-and-flash-loans","wordCount":876,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"oracle-manipulation","title":"预言机操纵与价格攻击","url":"/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/defi-security/oracle-manipulation","wordCount":791,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-chain-bridge-security","title":"跨链桥安全","url":"/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/defi-security/cross-chain-bridge-security","wordCount":949,"readingTime":4}],"introMarkdown":"# DeFi 安全\n\n本章深入分析 DeFi 协议面临的三大类高频攻击：重入攻击与闪电贷组合利用、预言机操纵与价格攻击、跨链桥安全。这三类攻击在 2024-2026 年间造成了超过 80% 的 DeFi 资金损失。\n\n每篇文档均包含攻击原理剖析、真实案例复盘、检测方法与防御方案。重点关注攻击者如何利用协议间的可组合性放大单一漏洞的破坏力。\n"}